{
  "name": "Audit Naver Place reviews with OpenAI and route ORM replies to Gmail, Sheets, and Slack",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Audit Naver Place reviews with OpenAI and route ORM replies to Gmail, Sheets, and Slack\n\n### How it works\n\nThis workflow runs every six hours to extract fresh records through the **[naver-place-reviews-scraper](https://apify.com/unitbytes/naver-place-reviews-scraper?fpr=939u3w&fp_sid=n8n_io)** UnitBytes Apify actor ($0.0008 / item), remove previously seen items by `reviewId`, and normalize and score the dataset (`reviewId, placeId, placeName, authorNickname`). It maps the cleaned fields for export, logs all rows to **Google Sheets**, creates a backup **CSV** file, and sends only high-priority records into **OpenAI (`gpt-4o-mini`)** for structured analysis and action drafting. The enriched fields are then merged and delivered to **Slack** and **Gmail**.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- Configure the schedule interval in **When Every 6 Hours** if six hours is not ideal for your cadence.\n- Add your Apify API token from [naver-place-reviews-scraper on Apify Store](https://apify.com/unitbytes/naver-place-reviews-scraper?fpr=939u3w&fp_sid=n8n_io) (`Authorization: Bearer <YOUR_APIFY_TOKEN>`) in **Post to Naver Place Reviews Scraper API** and confirm `actorInput` in **Set Search Parameters**.\n- Connect **Google Sheets** credentials in **Append Data to Sheets** and select your destination spreadsheet.\n- Configure **OpenAI** credentials in **AI Review Triage and Response Drafter** and review the `gpt-4o-mini` system prompt.\n- Connect **Slack** and **Gmail** credentials on the final delivery nodes.\n- Review `alertStarThreshold` and `priorityKeyword` in **Set Search Parameters** before activating.\n\n### Customization\n\nAdjust `actorInput`, `alertStarThreshold`, `priorityKeyword`, the OpenAI prompt, Slack message formatting, and Gmail template fields to match your workflow. Full schema and input docs: [https://unitbytes.com/actors/naver-place-reviews-scraper/](https://unitbytes.com/actors/naver-place-reviews-scraper/)",
        "width": 480,
        "height": 896
      },
      "id": "8a514d5a-eb18-5487-b2bb-9211caff2f91",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
